  "Question": "The monthly salaries of 6 people, in thousands of yuan, are 5, 6, 6, 7, 7, 7. If the last 7 is replaced with 31, by how many thousand yuan does the mean increase?",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "4",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The sum increases by $31-7=24$, so the mean increases by $24\\div6=4$; the median remains $(6+7)\\div2=6.5$, unchanged.",
